        "camera": "shake",
        "transition": "cut",
        "emphasis": [
          "cereal"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "Then Ode showed me the trick, and it is only three folds.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "process",
        "headline": "Three folds",
        "items": [
          "Fold it in half",
          "Fold both corners in",
          "Fold the wings down"
        ],
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "ode",
            "pose": "point",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "props": [
          {
            "kind": "book"
          },
          {
            "kind": "arrow"
          },
          {
            "kind": "star"
          }
        ],
        "setting": "notebook",
        "camera": "pan-right",
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "The secret is the nose. Keep it heavy and the whole thing glides.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "dialogue",
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "ode",
            "pose": "talk",
            "position": "right",
            "line": "Heavy nose, long glide."
          },
          {
            "ref": "wren",
            "pose": "think",
            "position": "left",
            "line": "Wait, that is it?"
          }
        ],
        "setting": "desk",
        "camera": "static",
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      "speaker": "ode"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "Mine used to fall in two seconds. Now it floats for about eight.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "big-number",
        "number": {
          "value": 8,
          "suffix": " sec",
          "label": "in the air"
        },
        "props": [
          {
            "kind": "clock"
          }
        ],
        "setting": "corkboard",
        "camera": "push-in",
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "Before, it was a crumpled mess. After, it looks like it belongs in the sky.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "compare",
        "headline": "Before and after",
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "wren",
            "pose": "sad",
            "position": "center"
          }
        ],
        "setting": "desk",
        "camera": "static",
        "transition": "cut",
        "compare": {
          "before": "Crumpled",
          "after": "Gliding"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "So if yours keeps crashing, add weight to the front and try again.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "recap",
        "headline": "Quick recap",
        "items": [
          "Fold in half",
          "Corners in",
          "Heavy nose"
